  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1605.03 Application Procedures.\n\n(a) Any person who wishes to apply for an original explosive license shall do the following:\n\n(1) Appear in person at the department, room 106, during normal business hours;\n\n(2) Supply proof of identification such as a valid driver's license or birth certificate;\n\n(3) If the application is for a user's license, the applicant, if a natural person, shall furnish 2 recent photographs, 1 1/4\" by 1 1/4\", of him or herself; and\n\n(4) Complete the application form:\n\na. If for a user license, DSSP 110 “Application for License to Use, Purchase and Transport Explosives”, effective May 2013; or\n\nb. If for a storage license, DSSP 109, “Application for License to Store Explosive Material”, effective May 2013; or\n\nc. If for a seller’s license, DSSP 108, “Application for License to Market and Sell Explosives”, effective May 2013; and\n\n(5) Make payment of the fee as specified in RSA 158:9-c.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1600.html"
